  <content_rules>
    <use_realistic_local_content>
      Use Ridgewood High School, Ridgewood Train Station, downtown Ridgewood, neighborhood streets,
      and a Ridgewood Pilot label. Keep all sample durations, distances, and scores consistent:
      Fastest: 14 min, 0.7 mi, 62.
      Balanced: 16 min, 0.8 mi, 81.
      Most pedestrian-friendly: 19 min, 0.9 mi, 92.
    </use_realistic_local_content>

    <voice>
      Clear, modest, and practical. Prefer:
      “More pedestrian-friendly,” “street characteristics,” “simpler crossings,”
      “calmer streets,” “check in,” “compare routes,” and “use extra care.”
